author_final_remarks.value:
**We sincerely thank the Program Chairs, Senior Area Chairs, Area Chairs, and all Reviewers for their time, effort, and constructive feedback throughout the review process.** The comments and suggestions have been invaluable in helping us further clarify our contributions and strengthen the manuscript.

During the rebuttal phase, we carefully addressed all concerns raised by the reviewers:
1. We expanded the baseline evaluation of open-ended QA tasks with more comprehensive metrics, incorporating additional proprietary LLMs and deep temporal models;
2. We clarified the novelty and technical advantages of our benchmark, the first multimodal TPP dataset that fills a critical gap in the field, and expanded the related work discussion. And we also emphasized dataset diversity from cultural-linguistic generalizability, and the content/task diversity;
3. We clarified task definitions, data input formats, dataset scale and distribution, and event types in the TTP data, thereby offering a more complete specification. Additionally, we provided detailed explanations and concrete examples of how our multi-agent framework ensures rigorous quality control during dataset construction, evidencing the dataset’s high quality;
4. We highlighted our adherence to ethical guidelines, addressing copyright and data usage compliance, privacy and anonymization, and mitigation of harmful content, while clarifying our extensive efforts in collection, filtering, and preprocessing to ensure safety.

**We are pleased that our responses have resolved all concerns raised by the reviewers, and we sincerely appreciate the recognition and support for our work.** We are deeply grateful for the acknowledgment of the significant impact of our dataset in the TPP domain. In addition, we thank the reviewers for their positive assessment of our comprehensive baseline evaluation and for recognizing our substantial efforts in addressing potential ethical concerns. Your valuable and constructive comments have helped us further strengthen and refine our work.

We believe these revisions and clarifications fully resolve the raised issues and further demonstrate the significance, soundness, and robustness of our work. We are grateful for the opportunity to engage in this constructive dialogue. Thank you once again.

Respectfully,  

The Authors

